## Command Center

Composed FROM the generic Dashboard primitive plus three strips. The wall's law: EVERY NUMBER IS A DOOR — tiles, rows, bars and ack rows all open their backing set. The empty state is the green state ("Queue clear"), because an ops wall with nothing at risk is good news, not an absence.

```gts
<CommandCenter
  @tiles={{this.tiles}}
  @breachRows={{this.breachRows}}
  @queues={{this.queues}}
  @escalations={{this.acks}}
  @onOpenCard={{this.open}}
/>
```

The linked example builds the wall from five cases, their SLA and their escalations.

### Non-goals

Owns no queries — data arrives prepared, so any desk can put its own numbers on the same wall.
